   "es": "Don Alonso de Ercilla.",
   "en": "Don Alonso de Ercilla.",
   "note": "Alonso de Ercilla (1533–94), soldier and poet, author of the epic <em>La Araucana</em>. Wilson notes that, once back in Spain from Chile, he signed the approvals of many books <span class=\"cites\">(<a class=\"cite\" href=\"about.html#bib-wilsonCervantesItemEmmanuel1968\" data-key=\"wilsonCervantesItemEmmanuel1968\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Wilson 1968, 367</a>)</span>.",
