   "es": "De Liñan de Riaça.",
   "en": "By Liñán de Riaza.",
   "note": "Pedro Liñán de Riaza (d. Madrid 1607), a Madrid poet. Wilson points out that most of his poems were printed without his name in the <em>Romancero general</em> (1600), which makes attribution hard <span class=\"cites\">(<a class=\"cite\" href=\"about.html#bib-wilsonCervantesItemEmmanuel1968\" data-key=\"wilsonCervantesItemEmmanuel1968\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Wilson 1968, 367</a>)</span>. The name is printed <em>Riaça</em>.",
   "lit": "",
