   "es": "Con licencia y Priuilegio.",
   "en": "With license and privilege.",
   "note": "The license is the permission to print; the privilege, the exclusive right to print and sell the book. Below this line the copy has several lines of illegible manuscript scribbles or pen trials, not text. pdf 70–72 (blank page, endleaf with library label, back cover) carry no printed text.",
